    "title": "No. 8 Mustangs fall short of reverse sweep, drop contest against Sioux Falls - NewsBreak",
    "text": "smsumustangs.com\nwebsite\nSioux Falls\nNo. 8 Mustangs fall short of reverse sweep, drop contest against Sioux Falls\n1 days ago\nSIOUX FALLS, S.D. – The Southwest Minnesota State volleyball squad (8-2, 1-2 NSIC) was defeated Tuesday against the Sioux Falls Cougars (7-4, 2-1 NSIC) in five sets, 22-25, 27-29, 25-20, 25-11, 6-15. Mya Krystosek and Leah Jones both led the Mustangs in kills with 18, with Krystosek hitting .259, and was second in digs with 15. Natalie Pilney had a career high in kills with 15, and hit .278 in the match.",
